 "law": "AmberOne's tolls including VAT, in force from 2012-02-11 (the per-km rates set by the Minister of Infrastructure): a closed system of twelve toll stations, priced from the station of entry to that of exit, the same for categories 2, 3 and 4 (two, three, or more than three axles, at least one with twin wheels): PLN 71 Rusocin-Nowa Wieś. The e-TOLL doesn't charge this stretch. The stations are placed at the motorway junctions of their names and their toll booths in OpenStreetMap. AmberGO automatic payment changes nothing in the price.",
